Capability sentinel for the apply-simulation-workflow probe.

The probe executes committed fixtures under testdata/workflows/apply-simulation
through the real Ptah CLI. It exercises the `schema apply` guard rails from
stokaro/ptah#812: `--lock-timeout` is accepted (an explicit noted no-op on
lockless SQLite), `--dev-url` resets the dev database and rehearses the exact
plan there before the target is touched, a plan whose rehearsal fails is
refused with exit 1 and the target left unchanged (the failing plan is
engineered with a hermetic scripted $EDITOR through --edit, the same
technique Ptah's own tests use), and pointing --dev-url at the target itself
is refused before the destructive dev reset.
